# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:4
translate italian work0_f28cee14:

    # "Immediately after finishing up my classes for the day, I head out to the car and drive over to the Law Offices, where my new job is."
    "Subito dopo aver finito le lezioni della giornata, esco e vado in macchina allo studio legale, dove ho il mio nuovo lavoro."

# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:7
translate italian work0_5a8d723c:

    # "I walk in to work. Dana is sitting in the lobby. I wave hello to her."
    "Entro al lavoro. Dana è seduta nell’atrio. Le faccio un cenno di saluto."

# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:8
translate italian work0_468fc973:

    # cw "Hey there new guy. [pcname], wasn't it?"
    cw "Ehi, nuovo arrivato. [pcname], vero?"

# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:9
translate italian work0_749220c3:

    # pc "That's me."
    pc "Sono io."

# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:10
translate italian work0_9e8ad45b:

    # cw "Mrs. Mills is back in her office. Go right ahead. Hope you have a good day."
    cw "La signora Mills è nel suo ufficio. Entra pure. Ti auguro una buona giornata."

# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:11
translate italian work0_efe7c8fa:

    # pc "Thanks, you too."
    pc "Grazie, anche a te."

# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:13
translate italian work0_58488fe0:

    # "I go back to Mrs. Mills' office."
    "Mi dirigo verso l’ufficio della signora Mills."

# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:15
translate italian work0_532a1db6:

    # "She sits at her desk, barely glancing up at me when I walk in."
    "È seduta alla sua scrivania e mi lancia appena un’occhiata quando entro."

# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:17
translate italian work0_d41d8cd9:

    # voice 'voices/mills_goodafternoon.mp3'
    voice 'voices/mills_goodafternoon.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:18
translate italian work0_640a0bfd:

    # bs "Good afternoon. I hope you're ready to work."
    bs "Buon pomeriggio. Spero che tu sia pronta a lavorare."

# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:19
translate italian work0_c24d08f6:

    # pc "Yes, ma'am, I am."
    pc "Sì, signora, lo sono."

# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:20
translate italian work0_cc9bf2b9:

    # bs "Good."
    bs "Bene."

# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:22
translate italian work0_4d725376:

    # "I spend most of the day cleaning. The place had gotten pretty bad over the few weeks where she didn't have an assistant and Mrs. Mills wants the place to be spotless."
    "Passo gran parte della giornata a pulire. Il posto era diventato piuttosto incasinato nelle poche settimane in cui lei non ha avuto un’assistente e la signora Mills vuole che sia immacolato."

# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:23
translate italian work0_e7ab64bb:

    # "I dust everything, wipe every surface, vacuum the floor, and organize all the paperwork."
    "Spolvero tutto, pulisco ogni superficie, passo l’aspirapolvere sul pavimento e metto in ordine tutte le pratiche."

# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:25
translate italian work0_67f863e2:

    # "Afterwards, Mrs. Mills has me type all her notes while she dictates. Luckily, I'm a fast typist because she is a fast talker and doesn't slow down at all."
    "Dopodiché, la signora Mills mi fa battere a macchina tutti i suoi appunti mentre lei mi detta. Per fortuna sono veloce a battere a macchina, perché lei parla velocemente e non rallenta affatto."

# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:26
translate italian work0_cec5844a:

    # "Finally, when it is time to go, she looks over the notes that I had typed and gives a little nod."
    "Infine, quando è ora di andare, dà un’occhiata agli appunti che ho digitato e annuisce leggermente."

# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:30
translate italian work0_d41d8cd9_1:

    # voice 'voices/mills_didgoodwork.mp3'
    voice 'voices/mills_didgoodwork.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:31
translate italian work0_7e667a4e:

    # bs "You did good work today. Keep it up and maybe you'll be able to stick around here for a while."
    bs "Hai fatto un buon lavoro oggi. Continua così e forse potrai restare qui per un po’."

# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:32
translate italian work0_a9a2d1b9:

    # pc "Thanks."
    pc "Grazie."

# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:33
translate italian work0_cd3b9566:

    # bs "See you tomorrow."
    bs "Ci vediamo domani."

# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:34
translate italian work0_a5da4cbe:

    # pc "Okay, goodbye, Mrs. Mills."
    pc "Ok, arrivederci, signora Mills."

# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:37
translate italian work0_bab3cfa9:

    # "I walk out and down the hall to the lobby. There, Dana is still working, sorting paperwork at her desk."
    "Esco e percorro il corridoio fino all’atrio. Lì, Dana sta ancora lavorando, smistando documenti alla sua scrivania."

# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:38
translate italian work0_7c1acf53:

    # pc "Goodnight Dana."
    pc "Buonanotte, Dana."

# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:40
translate italian work0_d41d8cd9_2:

    # voice "voices/dana_seeyoutomorrow.mp3"
    voice "voices/dana_seeyoutomorrow.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:41
translate italian work0_68df17d0:

    # cw "Oh, goodnight, [pcname]. See you tomorrow."
    cw "Oh, buonanotte, [pcname]. Ci vediamo domani."

# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:43
translate italian work0_ef83833d:

    # "I go outside and stand in front of the building for a moment, breathing the fresh air."
    "Esco e mi fermo un attimo davanti all’edificio, respirando l’aria fresca."

# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:44
translate italian work0_9dec6a30:

    # "It has been a long day and I'm exhausted. And this is only the first. Every weekday is going to be like this basically, leaving me only the evenings to do whatever I want."
    "È stata una giornata lunga e sono esausto. E questa è solo la prima. Praticamente ogni giorno feriale sarà così, lasciandomi solo le serate per fare quello che voglio."

# game/Scenes/Work/work0.rpy:45
translate italian work0_d7ac5816:

    # "So, what do I want to do now?"
    "Allora, cosa voglio fare adesso?"

